# Local dev secrets for `wrangler pages dev`. Copy this file to `.dev.vars`
# (gitignored — never commit real values) and fill in test values; wrangler
# reads it automatically.
#
# See DEPLOY.md's "Environment variables" table for what each one does and
# how to set it for a real deployment.

# Required — any value works locally, but use a real random secret in prod.
SESSION_SECRET=local-dev-testing-secret-not-real

# Required — encrypts ACH banking info at rest. The banking-info step of a
# service application 500s without this set.
PAYMENT_ENCRYPTION_KEY=local-dev-payment-key-not-real-either

# Optional but strongly recommended for production document envelopes.
# Base64-encoded DER PKCS#8 P-256 EC private key. When configured, completed
# envelopes are sealed with ECDSA-P256-SHA256. Keep the private key only in
# Cloudflare secrets; never commit it. Without this key, the app falls back to
# an HMAC-SHA256 server seal using SESSION_SECRET (tamper-evident but not
# independently public-key verifiable).
# DOCUMENT_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=
# DOCUMENT_SIGNING_KEY_ID=pmv-document-key-2026-01

# Optional — email delivery via Resend. Leave unset to develop with ordinary
# notification email as a safe no-op. Account-email attempts are stored as
# "skipped" so HQ can distinguish provider configuration from delivery.
# RESEND_API_KEY=

# Optional — only needed to verify real Resend/Svix webhook callbacks locally
# if HQ has not already stored the signing secret from Create webhook.
# RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Optional — Auth0 Regular Web Application (server-only). Leave unset to keep
# Google/Microsoft sign-in hidden. Never put AUTH0_CLIENT_SECRET in frontend env.
# AUTH0_DOMAIN=your-tenant.auth0.com
# AUTH0_CLIENT_ID=
# AUTH0_CLIENT_SECRET=
# AUTH0_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:8788/api/auth/auth0/callback
# AUTH0_LOGOUT_URL=http://localhost:8788/portal/login
# AUTH0_AUDIENCE=
# AUTH0_CONNECTIONS=google-oauth2,windowslive
# AUTH0_CONNECTION_GOOGLE=google-oauth2
# AUTH0_CONNECTION_MICROSOFT=windowslive
# AUTH0_ENABLED=true
